msgstr "تمكين الخدمة"

msgid "Check interval (seconds)"
msgstr "التحقق من الفاصل الزمني (ثواني)"

msgid "Failures before modem reboot"
msgstr "فشل قبل إعادة تشغيل المودم"

msgid "Offline timeout before reboot (seconds)"
msgstr "Offline timeout before reboot (seconds)"

msgid "How long to wait after internet loss before rebooting the modem. If the connection returns during this time, the reboot is cancelled. Set to 0 to reboot immediately."
msgstr "How long to wait after internet loss before rebooting the modem. If the connection returns during this time, the reboot is cancelled. Set to 0 to reboot immediately."

msgid "Ping hosts"
msgstr "المضيفين بينغ"

msgid "Space-separated list. Internet is considered up if at least one host responds."
msgstr "قائمة مفصولة بمسافة. يعتبر الإنترنت جاهزًا إذا استجاب مضيف واحد على الأقل."

msgid "Also require DNS resolution"
msgstr "تتطلب أيضًا حل DNS"

